# ── skill-evolution systems: ship ONLY our tri-track family + its deps ──────────
# Ignore all experimental skill_evo_* variants, then re-include the 5 packages the
# tri-track system actually needs (tri_track + merged + planner/planner_tri/
# planner_audit deps). Run RESULTS are already ignored via results/ above.
src/systems/skill_evo_*/
!src/systems/skill_evo_planner/
!src/systems/skill_evo_planner_audit/
!src/systems/skill_evo_planner_tri/
!src/systems/skill_evo_tri_track/
!src/systems/skill_evo_tri_track_merged/
# skill_evolution (old monolith): untracked via git rm --cached; keep it out of future commits
src/systems/skill_evolution/

